Apple is sending email surveys to some <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> buyers to get feedback on display size, crease, under-display camera, and other features.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/hero_medium_2x-feature1.jpg" alt="" width="1466" height="825" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1072525" /><br/>
The first question asks why the buyer chose the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; now, with answers like "I wanted to try Apple's first foldable," "It was an impulse purchase," and "I expect smartphone prices to increase."<br/>
<br/>
Other questions ask about the size of the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj;'s display when it's closed, how visible the crease is, whether the under-display camera is distracting, and the camera's image quality. The final question is open-ended and asks what the buyer would add or change about the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj;.<br/>
<br/>
<p><img src="https://images.macrumors.com/t/1NW4mzdGEBabfaq4UPopcQLgIJE=/800x0/article-new/2026/11/iphone-duo-survey-1.jpg" alt=""></p><p><a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/05/apple-iphone-duo-survey/#gallery-1075997-1">View all 6 photos in the full article →</a></p><br/>
It's been about two weeks since the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; launched, and it's not too unusual for Apple to conduct surveys following a new product's debut.<br/>
<br/>
Some of the questions are about &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; compromises compared to standard iPhone models. The Duo's outer display is 5.4 inches, making it about the same size as the discontinued iPhone mini line. The inner display's under-screen camera is limited to 4MP, and it was one of the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/review/iphone-duo/">main complaints in reviews</a>.<br/>
<br/>
The survey does not ask about <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/touch-id/">Touch ID</a>, the experience of using unoptimized apps, or the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/23/iphone-duo-screen-cracks/">display cracks</a> some users have reported, all of which are also top Duo complaints,<br/>
